      "text": "add() returns. Its stack frame is GONE instantly.\nsum, a, b are wiped (SP moves back up).\nresult in main() = 7. Zero cleanup cost!",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "add() returns. Its stack frame is GONE instantly.\nsum, a, b are wiped (SP moves back up).\nresult in main() = 7. Zero cleanup cost!",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
